#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
plexden — gerencia unificada da stack Plex + qBittorrent + Cloudflare Tunnel.

Substitui os 7 scripts bash antigos (plex-services, plex-stack-start,
plex-start, plexmediaserver.init, qb-cli, qb-postprocess, update-plex) por um
unico dispatcher com subcomandos. So depende da stdlib do Python 3 (nenhum
pacote via pip).

  plexden services {start|stop|restart|watch [segs]}          (root)
  plexden services status                                     (dispensa root)
  plexden qb {list|paths|pause|resume|setlocation} ...
  plexden postprocess "<nome>" "<caminho>"                    (AutoRun do qB)
  plexden links [--scan] [--apply]                            (limpa a biblioteca)
  plexden update                                              (root)
  plexden plex-exec                                           (entrypoint do Plex)
  plexden _init {start|stop|status|restart}                  (stub SysV)

Pontos de integracao (caminho fixo) viram stubs de 1 linha que chamam este
script:
  /etc/init.d/plexmediaserver   -> plexden _init "$@"
  ~/bin/plex-start              -> plexden plex-exec
  AutoRun do qBittorrent.conf   -> plexden postprocess "%N" "%F"
"""
